"""
Alternating L2O Transformer for Joint Sensing & Communication Beamforming (ISAC)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

- Communication beamformer:   W ∈ C^{N * K},  ||W||_F = 1
- Sensing beamformer:         F ∈ C^{N * N},  ||F||_F = 1
- Channels:
    * Comm H ∈ C^{K * N}  (row k is user-k channel)
    * Sensing single-target H_m = β_m a_r(θ_m) a_t(θ_m)^H ∈ C^{N * N}
    * Active set M ⊆ {1,...,M_total}. Effective G = sum_{m∈M} H_m, normalized to ||G||_F = N
- Losses:
    * L_comm = - SumRate(H, W, F) , where SINR_k denominator adds sensing leakage ||h_k F||^2
    * L_sense = - sum_{m∈M} min(0, SNR_m - η), with SNR_m = (||H_m W||_F^2 + ||H_m F||_F^2) / \sigma_z^2

Author: (adapted for your project)
"""

